msgid "Generate report"
msgstr "Xerar informe"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Generate a short report describing the sequential design, priors, "
"thresholds, and achieved probabilities."
msgstr ""
"Xerar un breve informe que describe o deseño secuencial, as previas, os "
"lindeiros e as probabilidades acadadas."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "LaTeX formatted output"
msgstr "Resultado con formato de LaTeX"

