msgstr "Resultados de deseño"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Design summary"
msgstr "Resumo de deseño"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the main sequential-design result: the maximum sample size or the "
"achieved probability of conclusive evidence."
msgstr ""
"Amosar o resultado principal do deseño secuencial: o máximo tamaño mostral "
"ou a probabilidade acadada da evidencia concluínte."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Sample size summary"
msgstr "Resumo do tamaño mostral"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the expected sample size and its variability under each design prior."
msgstr ""
"Amosar o tamaño mostral agardado e a súa variabilidade baixo cada previa de "
"deseño."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Decision probabilities"
msgstr "Probabilidades das decisións"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show final probabilities of evidence for H₁, evidence for H₀, and "
"inconclusive evidence under each design prior."
msgstr ""
"Amosar as probabilidades finais de evidencia para H₁, evidencia para H₀ e "
"evidencia non concluínte baixo cada previa de deseño."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Design specification"
msgstr "Especificación de deseño"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the analysis and design priors used for computing and evaluating the "
"Bayes factor sequential design."
msgstr ""
"Amosar as previas de análise e de deseño utilizadas para calcular e avaliar "
"o deseño secuencial de factores de Bayes."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Look-by-Look Results"
msgstr "Resultados aparencia a aparencia"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Cumulative decision probabilities"
msgstr "Probabilidades acumuladas de decisións"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the probability that the study has stopped for each decision by each "
"planned look."
msgstr ""
"Amosar a probabilidade de que o estudo se detivese para cada decisión por "
"cada aparencia planeada."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Incremental decision probabilities"
msgstr "Probabilidades graduais de decisións"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the probability that each decision is first reached at a given look."
msgstr ""
"Amosar a probabilidade de que cada decisión sexa a primeira acadada nunha "
"aparencia dada."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Stopping boundaries"
msgstr "Límites de parada"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the test-statistic values corresponding to the Bayes factor stopping "
"thresholds at each look."
msgstr ""
"Amosar os valores dos estatísticos de proba que corresponden cos lindeiros "
"de parada dos factores de Bayes, para cada aparencia."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "Gráficas"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Decision Probability"
msgstr "Probabilidade da decisión"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Plot how stopping probabilities for conclusive, misleading, and inconclusive "
"evidence accumulate across looks."
msgstr ""
"Debuxar como se acumulan as probabilidades de parada para a evidencia "
"concluínte, confusa e non concluínte, a través das aparencias."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Plot the test-statistic boundaries that trigger stopping for H₁ or H₀ at "
"each look."
msgstr ""
"Debuxar os límites dos estatísticos de proba que provocan a parada para H₁ "
"ou H₀, en cada aparencia."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Combine H₁ and H₀"
msgstr "Combinar H₁ e H₀"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Display curves for the H₁ and H₀ design priors in one figure instead of "
"separate figures."
msgstr ""
"Presentar curvas para as previas de deseño de H₁ e H₀ nunha imaxe, en lugar "
"de imaxes separadas."

